team-4776500","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.7: The Homeowners Have Arrived!","summary":"Hi everyone! Steam Next Fest has begun, and we've brought our biggest demo update yet. The biggest change: the houses aren't empty anymore, the homeowners are waiting for you! HighlightsHomeowners: They greet you on every job and watch the whole move. They react instantly to items hitting walls, broken parts and thrown boxes. Each one has their own personality and a favorite item. Keep them happy for a big tip, but make them too angry and they'll come after you! In the demo you'll meet Picky Aun","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:18:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688184","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4776500-1846018067939301","game_id":"steam-4776500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Smoother Carrying, Higher FPS","summary":"Hi everyone! Thank you to everyone who played the demo and left a review. Most of you mentioned physics bugs, stuttering and how hard carrying felt, so this update is built entirely around that. Highlights Smoother carrying: Your grip no longer breaks during two-player carrying, and items no longer clip into your body or snag on the ground. Physics fixes: Removed the invisible collider bug that stopped players and items in their tracks. The truck no longer gets flung around, and items no longer ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T20:06:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939301","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4776500-1846018067933143","game_id":"steam-4776500","kind":"announcement","title":"Carry On Together Demo Is OUT NOW!","summary":"Hello everyone!We're incredibly excited to share some great news with you! After a long period of development, the free demo of Carry On Together is finally available to play on Steam!Are you ready to start a moving company with your friends, take on challenging deliveries, and experience plenty of hilarious moments along the way?Carry On Together is a physics-based cooperative moving game that supports up to 4 players in online co-op. Together, you'll carry furniture, drive moving trucks, and t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T12:23:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933143","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4776500-1846018067929087","game_id":"steam-4776500","kind":"announcement","title":"We Hit 10,000 Wishlists — Thank You!","summary":"Carry On Together just reached 10,000 wishlists on Steam! As a small indie team, your support means the world to us — thank you for every single wishlist!See you at Steam Next Fest (October 19–26) with our demo!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T10:07:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929087","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4776500-1844751498228161","game_id":"steam-4776500","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome, Russia and Kazakhstan!","summary":"We're thrilled to see so many new players from Russia and Kazakhstan wishlisting Carry On Together!Thanks for joining us — you're now part of a community that will haul furniture with friends, cause chaos, and try not to break everything along the way.We'll be showing off a playable demo very soon at Steam Next Fest. If you haven't wishlisted yet, it helps us out a lot!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T22:16:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228161","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4776500-1844751498225220","game_id":"steam-4776500","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for 1,000 Wishlists!","summary":"We did it! Carry On Together has reached 1,000 wishlists, and more than half of them came in just the last few days. We're a small five-person indie team, and seeing this much support means the world to us.Every wishlist helps Steam show our game to more players, so thank you for adding it, sharing it with friends and following our journey.We're working hard on the next steps and have lots to show you soon. Start gathering your friends now, because nobody moves a couch alone. 😄👉 If you haven't y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T16:36:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225220","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4776500-1844115010487903","game_id":"steam-4776500","kind":"announcement","title":"Support Us by Wishlisting the Game!","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T02:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010487903","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4776500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:23Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4776500":"2026-10-26T14:08:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"477